{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/459c8085a97cf056c079528c7c7dd34e.avif?t=1760632503\" width=791 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Seven Enchantments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Seven Enchantments is a first-person psychological horror game set in the village of Pradonin, a forgotten place deep in 1800s Eastern Europe where religion, folklore, and sin intertwine. You are J\u00f3zef, a fraudulent exorcist sent to help, only to realize something real and terrifying awaits. What begins as a simple con spirals into a psychological descent as you uncover the dark truth behind seven cursed villagers, each consumed by one of the seven deadly sins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Dark, Twisting Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some revel in sin. Others suffer from it. But all who give in are changed, twisted, and cursed. As J\u00f3zef, uncover the intertwined stories of the villagers of Pradonin\u2014their secrets, their sins, and their fates.<br>Why did this village fall? Who is truly behind the evil lurking here?<br>As you search the shadows\u2026 some may begin to look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/2ac4a2975171ceb6f80fd6005034214d.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=796 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/2ac4a2975171ceb6f80fd6005034214d.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/2ac4a2975171ceb6f80fd6005034214d.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Seven Characters, Seven Fates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each villager you investigate represents a deadly sin. Explore their homes, trace their memories, and uncover clues. The truth might not be what you imagined, but J\u00f3zef must face it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Secrets Hidden in Every Corner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, stories are buried under rocks, behind doors, or in the quiet hum of the forest. But are you ready to discover how this story ends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/0a2b5e5d00d8274211409916bd9d6db8.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/0a2b5e5d00d8274211409916bd9d6db8.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/0a2b5e5d00d8274211409916bd9d6db8.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a cursed village</strong>: Every house, shrine, and shadow holds a secret tied to one of the seven deadly sins. Navigate dense forests, decaying huts, and sacred ritual sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/95549732b82267ed7344a7b1c4175a5b.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=800 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/95549732b82267ed7344a7b1c4175a5b.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/95549732b82267ed7344a7b1c4175a5b.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night cycle gameplay</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, gather resources like <strong>candles, ritual tools</strong>, and <strong>scent-based stealth items</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By night, <strong>survive the hunt</strong>. The <strong>Leshy</strong>, a deadly creature from Slavic folklore, stalks you. Sound and light are your enemies\u2014or your only hope.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigative horror</strong>: Find journals, ritual objects, and subtle environmental clues that piece together each villager\u2019s story and reveal the curse at the heart of Pradonin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/79ddb1d2cbbff95575d548f9f9f1248e.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/79ddb1d2cbbff95575d548f9f9f1248e.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/79ddb1d2cbbff95575d548f9f9f1248e.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-based storytelling</strong>: Ritual circles, grotesque remnants, and ancient relics are keys to solving the mystery. Your curiosity may be your salvation\u2014or your undoing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling &amp; puzzles</strong>: Ritual sites, cursed relics, and grotesque scenes slowly reveal the truth\u2014if you\u2019re willing to look closely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612720?t=1760632503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/0e39a11339fac0abb03a1b1415fa794337822333/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760632503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/350d911acb0cfd8eb83d3c539321da3a14215033/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760632503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/350d911acb0cfd8eb83d3c539321da3a14215033/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760632503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Seven Enchantments contains Depictions of Violence, Gore, Corpses, some Crude Language and a LOT of Blood. This is a Dark and Bleak Game so stay cautious"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3860470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/459c8085a97cf056c079528c7c7dd34e.avif?t=1760632503\" width=791 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Seven Enchantments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Seven Enchantments is a first-person psychological horror game set in the village of Pradonin, a forgotten place deep in 1800s Eastern Europe where religion, folklore, and sin intertwine. You are J\u00f3zef, a fraudulent exorcist sent to help, only to realize something real and terrifying awaits. What begins as a simple con spirals into a psychological descent as you uncover the dark truth behind seven cursed villagers, each consumed by one of the seven deadly sins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Dark, Twisting Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some revel in sin. Others suffer from it. But all who give in are changed, twisted, and cursed. As J\u00f3zef, uncover the intertwined stories of the villagers of Pradonin\u2014their secrets, their sins, and their fates.<br>Why did this village fall? Who is truly behind the evil lurking here?<br>As you search the shadows\u2026 some may begin to look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/2ac4a2975171ceb6f80fd6005034214d.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=796 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/2ac4a2975171ceb6f80fd6005034214d.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/2ac4a2975171ceb6f80fd6005034214d.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Seven Characters, Seven Fates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each villager you investigate represents a deadly sin. Explore their homes, trace their memories, and uncover clues. The truth might not be what you imagined, but J\u00f3zef must face it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Secrets Hidden in Every Corner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, stories are buried under rocks, behind doors, or in the quiet hum of the forest. But are you ready to discover how this story ends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/0a2b5e5d00d8274211409916bd9d6db8.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/0a2b5e5d00d8274211409916bd9d6db8.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/0a2b5e5d00d8274211409916bd9d6db8.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a cursed village</strong>: Every house, shrine, and shadow holds a secret tied to one of the seven deadly sins. Navigate dense forests, decaying huts, and sacred ritual sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/95549732b82267ed7344a7b1c4175a5b.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=800 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/95549732b82267ed7344a7b1c4175a5b.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/95549732b82267ed7344a7b1c4175a5b.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night cycle gameplay</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, gather resources like <strong>candles, ritual tools</strong>, and <strong>scent-based stealth items</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By night, <strong>survive the hunt</strong>. The <strong>Leshy</strong>, a deadly creature from Slavic folklore, stalks you. Sound and light are your enemies\u2014or your only hope.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigative horror</strong>: Find journals, ritual objects, and subtle environmental clues that piece together each villager\u2019s story and reveal the curse at the heart of Pradonin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/79ddb1d2cbbff95575d548f9f9f1248e.poster.avif?t=1760632503\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/79ddb1d2cbbff95575d548f9f9f1248e.webm?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/extras/79ddb1d2cbbff95575d548f9f9f1248e.mp4?t=1760632503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-based storytelling</strong>: Ritual circles, grotesque remnants, and ancient relics are keys to solving the mystery. Your curiosity may be your salvation\u2014or your undoing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling &amp; puzzles</strong>: Ritual sites, cursed relics, and grotesque scenes slowly reveal the truth\u2014if you\u2019re willing to look closely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Revolt Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612720/2f1762a76bfd927b31c9cb6a2a1f983e736732a1/header.jpg?t=1760632503","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<s